{"availability":"available","full":"Ark0N/Codeman","name":"Codeman","description":"Self-hosted mission control for AI coding agents: run Claude Code, OpenCode, Pi, Codex, and Antigravity & Gemini CLI 24/7, from any device, watch every subagent live","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":783,"forks":114,"created":"2026-01-21T13:09:45Z","updated":"2026-10-09T17:26:40Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://getcodeman.com","topics":["agent","ai-agents","claude","claude-ai","claude-code","claude-code-marketplace","claude-code-plugin","claude-skills","codex","developer-tools","docker","gemini-cli","opencode","pi","self-hosted","session-manager","terminal","tmux","web-dashboard","xterm"],"demo":"https://getcodeman.com/install","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.121Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.121Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.121Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.121Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2108407067480662298","postId":"2108407067480662298","postedAt":"2026-10-09T03:59:51.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.556Z","stars":783,"forks":114}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Claude Code &bull; OpenCode &bull; Codex &bull; Antigravity &bull; Gemini &bull; Pi &bull; Grok &bull; DeepSeek &bull; OMP &bull; Terminal - One Dashboard &bull; Any Device","⭐ Like Codeman? Give it a star on GitHub! It takes one click and helps more people find the project. ⭐","Codeman is a self-hosted mission control for AI coding agents. It spawns Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, Antigravity, Gemini, Pi, Grok, DeepSeek Harness, or OMP inside persistent tmux sessions, streams the real terminal to any browser, and keeps agents productive after you walk away: it re-prompts on idle, resumes when a usage limit resets, runs scheduled jobs, and shows every background agent working in real time."],"features":["One dashboard, nine CLIs - run Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex, Antigravity, Gemini, Pi, Grok, DeepSeek, or OMP per session (plus plain shell), locally, in Docker, or over SSH, with your own dashboards open as web tabs…","Truly phone-friendly - a touch-optimized terminal with instant local echo, QR login, swipe navigation, and push notifications","Runs while you sleep - idle detection + respawn cycling and auto-resume when a subscription limit resets, for 24+ hour unattended runs","Nothing gets lost - tmux persistence across restarts and network drops, exactly-once input delivery, full-scrollback replay","Self-hosted and private - loopback-only by default, MIT licensed, no telemetry, runs entirely on your machine"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"5bc5fcc650bc5baaa25b08d83208e74697720513186ef69f463413470224c9cb","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:14.571Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.121Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Claude Code &bull; OpenCode &bull; Codex &bull; Antigravity &bull; Gemini &bull; Pi &bull; Grok &bull; DeepSeek &bull; OMP &bull; Terminal - One Dashboard &bull; Any Device","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Truly phone-friendly - a touch-optimized terminal with instant local echo, QR login, swipe navigation, and push notifications","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Everything that needs you, including one consent for all missing packages, one sudo password, and the Tailscale login, happens before the build, so you can walk away while it compiles.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Voice input — Ctrl+Shift+V (Deepgram Nova-3, or this machine's Claude Code login with no API key; auto-silence stop).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Voice input — dictate prompts with Deepgram Nova-3, or through this machine's Claude Code login with no API key at all (App Settings → Voice; Web Speech API fallback): toggle recording, auto-silence stop, live level meter (Ctrl+Shift+V)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"By default Codeman launches sessions with --dangerously-skip-permissions, so the web UI is by design a remote-code-execution surface for whoever can reach it — the whole security model exists to control who that is. (The startup permission mode is configurable; see below.) Recent hardening (v0.9.0 + v0.9.5) closes the browser-driven attack paths that bite self-hosted dev tools.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5bc5fcc650bc5baaa25b08d83208e74697720513186ef69f463413470224c9cb","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.121Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T17:26:40Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Ark0N/Codeman/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T19:04:12.121Z","hash":"5bc5fcc650bc5baaa25b08d83208e74697720513186ef69f463413470224c9cb","originalBytes":97726,"storedBytes":97726,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["codeman","api","session","sessions","claude","agent","docs","code","one","run","case","terminal","cli","never","web","input","install","every","post","full","password","bash","curl","only","see","tab","url","list","prompt","start","idle","own","same","when","each","get","server","settings","text","app","default","first","tmux","docker","runs","status","stop","any","before","desktop","respawn","service","shell","agents","container","inside","live","new","host","machine","mode","real","tunnel","across","cod